<!-- Loaded after Playnite's Default Media.xaml: keys it shares override Default's. -->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!--
        Playnite's progress indicator, shown in the top bar while it updates the library: the console's loading spinner,
        as Signing you in turns it round the profile's picture. A white arc with a green tail chases round a ring with
        round ends and no track ring under it, growing clockwise from a dot at the top and resting as the dot again
        before the next turn. The ring fills the control with its stroke inside it, as thick for its size as the one
        round the picture. Its keyframes are the extension's own spinner sampled 100 times a second; the Dashboard can't
        use the extension, so DashboardSpinnerTests keeps them matching it and prints new ones when they don't. It turns
        only while it is visible: Playnite collapses it when the library is idle, and it stops then rather than turning
        unseen.
    -->
